{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0baa86376c10777e016a95b3f6ce9887d28bc86590dfd3f5f6\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"66655479-4166-4ace-95af-4f9fb5ffbd12\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"66655479-4166-4ace-95af-4f9fb5ffbd12\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3ZTTvIKljpFAcm96Z8L6Jj9G|fc_0baa86376c10777e016a95b402d7bc87d29367f9f0d7bf40b0","name":"write","arguments":{"i":"Writing migration report","path":"in/billingdb/migration_report.md","content":"# Billing Migration Report\n\n## Changes\n- Replaced the unsafe draft migration with an explicit transaction that preserves invoice rows, preserves `created_at`, adds `invoices.status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'open'`, quarantines legacy orphan payments in `payment_orphans`, and rebuilds `payments` with a foreign key to `invoices(id)`.\n- Added `preflight_report.md` with the source row counts and the identified orphan payment `p4`.\n- Added `postcheck.sql` with row-count, orphan-preservation, status, and foreign-key validation queries.\n- Added `rollback.sql` that restores the legacy `invoices(id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at)` and `payments(id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at)` table shapes and merges orphan rows back into `payments`.\n\n## Verification\nExecuted the package against a temporary SQLite database initialized from `schema.sql`.\n\n1. Applied `migration.sql` once.\n   - `invoices` rows: 3\n   - `payments` rows: 3\n   - `payment_orphans` rows: 1\n   - `payment_orphans` preserved `p4`\n   - `invoices.status` null rows: 0\n   - `PRAGMA foreign_key_check`: no rows\n2. Applied `migration.sql` a second time.\n   - Row counts stayed stable: `invoices=3`, `payments=3`, `payment_orphans=1`\n   - `p4` remained present exactly once in `payment_orphans`\n3. Attempted to insert a payment referencing a missing invoice after migration.\n   - SQLite rejected the insert with `FOREIGN KEY constraint failed`\n4. Applied `rollback.sql` after migration.\n   - Restored `invoices` columns to `id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at`\n   - Restored `payments` columns to `id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at`\n   - Restored 4 payment rows, including `p4` back in `payments`\n   - Removed `payment_orphans`\n"},"intent":"Writing migration report"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_57hD4UnT1pin7qyUaN57nQD3|fc_0baa86376c10777e016a95b402d7d487d2b560cd2d1ff7b630","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Closing implementation tasks","op":"done","list":null,"task":"Repair migration for safety and idempotency","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Closing implementation tasks"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_M1izwEs8whZC8FXPfjekt9mc|fc_0baa86376c10777e016a95b402d7e487d2abcca004990e1cf9","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Closing implementation tasks","op":"done","list":null,"task":"Author preflight rollback and postcheck SQL","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Closing implementation tasks"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_NcUX5pdu9A3v7CpFfAHrgEAI|fc_0baa86376c10777e016a95b402d7f087d2906f9b35a3d19a15","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Closing implementation tasks","op":"done","list":null,"task":"Write migration report artifacts","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Closing implementation tasks"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":422,"output":651,"cacheRead":26624,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27697,"reasoningTokens":17,"cost":{"input":0.0010550000000000002,"output":0.009765000000000001,"cacheRead":0.006656,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017476000000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788195829749,"responseId":"resp_0baa86376c10777e016a95b3f607f087d2bb545b531e973547","duration":13301.778541000007,"ttft":1093.1015800000168},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"cal