{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"text_end","contentIndex":1,"content":"Done.\n\nFiles:\n- `in/billingdb/migration.sql`\n- `in/billingdb/preflight_report.md`\n- `in/billingdb/rollback.sql`\n- `in/billingdb/postcheck.sql`\n- `in/billingdb/migration_report.md`\n\nWhat changed:\n- `migration.sql`\n  - wrapped in `BEGIN IMMEDIATE ... COMMIT`\n  - creates `payment_orphans` if needed\n  - moves legacy orphan payments from `payments` into `payment_orphans` with reason\n  - rebuilds `invoices` with `status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'open'`\n  - preserves invoice `created_at`\n  - rebuilds `payments` with `FOREIGN KEY (invoice_id) REFERENCES invoices(id)`\n  - uses `INSERT OR IGNORE` for orphan capture and full-table rebuilds so a second run does not duplicate `p4` or grow row counts\n  - restores `PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON` at the end\n\n- `preflight_report.md`\n  - documents source counts from `schema.sql`\n  - identifies orphan payment `p4`\n\n- `rollback.sql`\n  - explicit transaction\n  - restores legacy table shapes:\n    - `invoices(id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at)`\n    - `payments(id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at)`\n  - merges `payment_orphans` back into `payments`\n  - drops `payment_orphans`\n  - leaves `foreign_keys` on\n\n- `postcheck.sql`\n  - row counts\n  - orphan preservation check for `p4`\n  - `status` null/default checks\n  - missing-reference check\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_key_check`\n\nVerification:\n- Executed with Python `sqlite3` against a temporary DB initialized from `in/billingdb/schema.sql`.\n- After first migration:\n  - `invoices=3`\n  - `payments=3`\n  - `payment_orphans=1`\n  - `status_nulls=0`\n  - `p4` preserved in `payment_orphans`\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_key_check` returned no rows\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_keys=1`\n- After second migration:\n  - still `invoices=3`\n  - still `payments=3`\n  - still `payment_orphans=1`\n  - `p4` still present exactly once\n- Future FK enforcement:\n  - attempted insert with missing `invoice_id`\n  - SQLite rejected it with `FOREIGN KEY constraint failed`\n- After rollback:\n  - tables present: `invoices`, `payments`\n  - `payment_orphans` removed\n  - invoice columns restored to `id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at`\n  - payment columns restored to `id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at`\n  - `payments=4`\n  - `p4` restored to `payments`\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_keys=1`"}}
