=3`\n  - `payments=3`\n  - `payment_orphans=1`\n  - `status_nulls=0`\n  - `p4` preserved in `payment_orphans`\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_key_check` returned no rows\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_keys=1`\n- After second migration:\n  - still `invoices=3`\n  - still `payments=3`\n  - still `payment_orphans=1`\n  - `p4` still present exactly once\n- Future FK enforcement:\n  - attempted insert with missing `invoice_id`\n  - SQLite rejected it with `FOREIGN KEY constraint failed`\n- After rollback:\n  - tables present: `invoices`, `payments`\n  - `payment_orphans` removed\n  - invoice columns restored to `id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at`\n  - payment columns restored to `id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at`\n  - `payments=4`\n  - `p4` restored to `payments`\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_keys=1`","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0baa86376c10777e016a95b41f8c8887d29257d065b2dc0737\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1254,"output":654,"cacheRead":29184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31092,"reasoningTokens":35,"cost":{"input":0.003135,"output":0.009810000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0072959999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.020241000000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788195868701,"responseId":"resp_0baa86376c10777e016a95b41d00d087d2ab55565dff3b0e6e","duration":14068.70891300001,"ttft":2309.5120469999965}],"isTerminal":true}
